               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Fixed in v2.0a47. Issue was that we must use va_copy to copy va_list elements, not just assignment/pass by value. Because with vswpr..intf... it munges the value, and if we re-run (cuz buffer not big enuf) - we get crash.",
